        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The employee will be paid at least 4% over his or her current pay rate or the minimum of the higher position's range, whichever is higher. If the employee is temporarily reclassified to a higher position, the salary of the new position shall not exceed the maximum salary of the higher level position.",
